&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftgD2V0KLusddbgyg_9DjOPX5YrP8-rIDFOQf7Yl6sM1w&oe=699C374D"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 4.png", "id": "25299459349722807", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_25299459369722805_1875565800982623569_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e5kICloIgWIQ7kNvwGNcqhk&_nc_oc=AdnhMcEBDdnR7gsq4epcZhnNS4GxCE0XHixeB3c0b2F7kzLP1MkDaMcGQp3seTFIJMQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftBfBjHOH5NM28MLVC62v6uzzdqYyfxY4zzJ_2P7tRb3A&oe=699C43CF"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 5.png", "id": "2038404890292862", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2038404893626195_50283950361106217_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8B8p41FOonMQ7kNvwF8u4aM&_nc_oc=AdlH2_RQUk-ngXnAOsf7lzs8RMUkdoo_aEY4PVvRFspliuI1Ykb0N0lgSlnA6KB2YLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftKgaQlbFQH48R4Vnqlbg6mFK5cz3YlJCFDVRN5nwqdmg&oe=699C3BB7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer poster.png", "id": "1340193764070608", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1340193767403941_2787865297931591383_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GL_vmCXrbT0Q7kNvwGGaXzm&_nc_oc=AdkNNBzVtiX70tmo-t1WP06D38wf-f6jZ9bp5wDZnHt-UC2iKI9oUr72wElHuZA5nLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuFWiNz0HZx3yzUHDctvvV47ogizMsrDJ6EBxFs3xOucA&oe=699C5298"}, "display_name": "Plank n' Kitty", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## Plank n' Kitty\n\nGran\u2019s cat has wandered off and ended up at the end of a plank high above the city!\n\nStep through the doorway into a virtual cartoon world, walk the plank, rescue the kitty, and bring it safely back to gran.\n\n**Plank \u2019n Kitty is a mixed-reality experience, not a game.**  \nIt\u2019s designed to be fun, approachable, and best enjoyed with friends or family taking turns.  \nEveryone can join in by watching the action on TV or mobile.\n\n---\n\n## What makes it different\n\n- **Two-way mixed-reality portal**  \n  A door in your room opens into a virtual world \u2014 and from the plank, the door becomes a portal back into your real room.\n\n- **Exciting but not extreme**  \n  High enough to feel thrilling, without pushing into fear-only territory. Accessible fun for everybody.\n\n- **Configurable play space**  \n  Preview and adjust the size and position to fit your room before you start.\n\n- **Perfect for group play**  \n  Take turns, watch reactions, and enjoy it together.\n\n- **TV casting support**  \n  Cast to a TV so everyone can see what the player sees.\n\n---\n\n## Device Support\nSupports mixed reality on Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.  \nPassthrough quality varies by device.\n\n---\n\n## Comfort Note\nThis experience involves real-world movement.  \nThis is a **room-scale mixed reality experience** and adapts to your available space.  \nMake sure your area is clear before playing.", "short_description": "Gran\u2019s cat has gone missing. Step through the portal, walk the plank high above the city, and bring the kitty home. A fun, approachable mixed-reality experience made for friends, families, and party play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rayamedia.com/home/plank-n-kitty-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rayamedia", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://rayamedia.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "support